{"author":{"id":"b409816c5cd5ab140d1d52eb33aace35de44952bb794b19806fd57f6ecb1ace9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790346891,"nonce":"x5uP5ExbAc+m0yDNnMeWS/p9dNE=","title":"ZynML's file_read and file_write name symbols zrtl_fs does not export","message":"ml.zyn maps file_read to $FS$read_string and file_write to $FS$write_string. zrtl_fs registers $FS$read_file and $FS$write_file, and no plugin exports the *_string names, so a call to either builtin has no symbol to resolve to. file_exists maps correctly. Both mappings date from the crate's first commit; an e2e test that reads and writes a file is owed with the fix.","files":null}]}